          "end": 550.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " part.",
          "start": 550.15,
          "end": 551.01,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Now, God's part is overwhelmingly far better than our part.",
