        },
        {
          "word": " much.",
          "start": 647.77,
          "end": 648.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because Satan may say \"Robert will blaspheme if you destroy his car against You.\"'",
