          "end": 653.21,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " against",
          "start": 653.21,
          "end": 656.19,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " You.\"'",
          "start": 656.19,
          "end": 657.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And God will tell Satan \"OK, go get his RX-7, but you cannot touch him.\"",
