          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " way.",
          "start": 670.07,
          "end": 670.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "I mean, Robert's car was forced under a truck. And after he left the car, he wondered how he was alive in there.",
