          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " know.",
          "start": 2192.35,
          "end": 2192.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They remind us that the earth is hanging in space.",
