          "end": 2474.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 2474.89,
          "end": 2474.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " beggar.",
          "start": 2474.89,
          "end": 2474.89,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, you'd better be careful. I'd rather be a (unintelligible) than breaking a commandment.",
      "start": 2480.89,
      "end": 2522.11,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 2480.89,
