          "end": 2524.47,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " least...",
          "start": 2524.47,
          "end": 2524.82,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "The least you can do is not reprimand the person",
