        },
        {
          "word": " it",
          "start": 2658.61,
          "end": 2658.75,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "\"Muhammad was astray\" and he wouldn't say it.",
      "start": 2658.75,
      "end": 2662.21,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " \"Muhammad",
