          "word": " encounters.",
          "start": 2664.65,
          "end": 2664.95,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Because when I showed him all the other verses showing that Muhammad did make mistakes, he would say \"ok\"",
