        },
        {
          "word": " it...",
          "start": 2706.25,
          "end": 2706.7,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Ironically, most of them, almost all of them, apply to Muhammad but they will not accept verse 7.",
