          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " angry.",
          "start": 2833.73,
          "end": 2834.18,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There's nothing in this world that is worth getting angry at.",
