          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " so",
          "start": 3847.47,
          "end": 3847.47,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " she",
          "start": 3847.47,
          "end": 3847.59,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " left",
          "start": 3847.59,
          "end": 3847.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " him.",
          "start": 3847.79,
          "end": 3848.29,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Of course, according to the Quran, marriage is a contract between two people, and once out, the contract is invalid anymore.",
      "start": 3849.69,
      "end": 3857.91,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
