          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " anymore.",
          "start": 3856.91,
          "end": 3857.91,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But they don't give this right to the woman, according to the so-called Islamic Shari'a.",
