          "word": " Shari'a.",
          "start": 3862.35,
          "end": 3863.17,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, I don't know how many months or years later, she married somebody else.",
      "start": 3863.93,
      "end": 3870.88,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 3863.93,
          "end": 3864.53,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " I",
          "start": 3865.32,
          "end": 3865.87,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " don't",
          "start": 3865.87,
          "end": 3866.01,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " know",
