          "end": 3883.13,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " adultery.",
          "start": 3883.13,
          "end": 3884.33,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, the judge ordered them stoned to death.",
      "start": 3884.33,
      "end": 3886.22,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 3884.33,
          "end": 3884.39,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 3884.45,
          "end": 3884.45,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " judge",
          "start": 3884.45,
          "end": 3884.63,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " ordered",
          "start": 3884.63,
          "end": 3884.93,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " them",
          "start": 3884.93,
          "end": 3885.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " stoned",
          "start": 3885.15,
          "end": 3885.49,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " to",
          "start": 3885.49,
          "end": 3885.67,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " death.",
          "start": 3885.67,
          "end": 3886.22,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And four of their friends were also stoned to death, because they knew about it.",
