          "end": 4569.51,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " God.",
          "start": 4570.35,
          "end": 4571.15,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "And this is why God ties the commandment of \"obeying God and obeying the messenger\" together throughout the Quran.",
