          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "But what it says is that here's a person who has been with you for many years and you know he's not crazy.",
      "start": 4616.55,
      "end": 4622.9,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " But",
          "start": 4616.55,
          "end": 4616.55,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " what",
          "start": 4616.55,
          "end": 4617.33,
