          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " 40.",
          "start": 4680.59,
          "end": 4680.97,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, he lived among his people for 40 years. They knew him as a normal person who was a merchant or a shepherd or",
