          "end": 4693.57,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " of",
          "start": 4693.57,
          "end": 4693.65,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " being",
          "start": 4693.65,
          "end": 4693.79,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " crazy.",
          "start": 4693.79,
          "end": 4694.19,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, he says \"I lived with you so many years and you didn't know that I was crazy. So, why do you call me crazy now?\"",
