          "word": " yes.",
          "start": 4711.81,
          "end": 4713.09,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, this is the idea.",
      "start": 4713.39,
      "end": 4714.72,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " So,",
          "start": 4713.39,
          "end": 4713.49,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " this",
          "start": 4713.49,
          "end": 4714.11,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " is",
          "start": 4714.11,
          "end": 4714.23,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " the",
          "start": 4714.23,
          "end": 4714.37,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        },
        {
          "word": " idea.",
          "start": 4714.37,
          "end": 4714.72,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Cause if you...If a person lives with you for so many years, you know him closely, and you know very well he's not crazy,",
      "start": 4716.23,
      "end": 4722.84,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
          "word": " Cause",
          "start": 4716.23,
