        },
        {
          "word": " horizon.",
          "start": 4776.97,
          "end": 4777.32,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Exactly where, I don't know, but it was out of this, out of this universe.",
      "start": 4779.01,
      "end": 4782.94,
      "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa",
      "words": [
        {
