        },
        {
          "word": " path.",
          "start": 4923.65,
          "end": 4924.17,
          "speaker": "Dr. Khalifa"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "So, those who wish to go straight will accept this heavy information. This is very heavy information.",
