          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " everything",
          "start": 5084.41,
          "end": 5085.47,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " they're",
          "start": 5085.47,
          "end": 5085.83,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        },
        {
          "word": " saying.",
          "start": 5085.83,
          "end": 5086.69,
          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "There are a lot of people who quote Quran, and read from the Quran and they say \"where did this explanation come from?\"",
