          "speaker": "Douglas"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "They say that God didn't send a messenger. But they immediately just continue to worshiping the messenger.",
      "start": 5093.93,
      "end": 5099.25,
      "speaker": "Douglas",
      "words": [
